    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec70b006e0d24099b939e641",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望您，能亲自见证……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "878919202066e7e5b69ebe96f2724700ed8a3ab499d100780fcbf475e9e084c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f5afb95b02ec26b87eca67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她和我，是相似的类型。一想到自己或许\n无法弥补她所欠缺的东西，我不禁有些踌躇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd8f47b6034bfe80465fc47384e8ce3dad61e04965bca7e99d44a3e5b182645",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2516f5cb251c8445ebb38a46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是——她那浅褐色的双眸在闪烁。\n紧握的双拳，也在微微颤抖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e126049532343994b5afc015344930a1a5cf5d665ba90ac6738db2d702dc491f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13cc8f326041cff0294706d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我知道了。我一定会去看比赛的",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9b8e482e56a7feded62ec1389f39961713cb2c199abd113e8398522ddf14c01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed3823bb8e8f1687a1743ed3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从她拼命挤出勇气向我诉说的身影中，我感受到了她的认真。\n——毫无疑问，她的心境正在发生变化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5628dc05488a2aea899d7cee40c7ffae8099a73b812f796784fc3a2788574c8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
