    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d660235dd726c524ca7fa20",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好的——！　我会加油的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b770414067a1d3118afc98ac2d71db7b772d2f2a1b741e4b385d3b85c6bf7cbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f36b7a3a7c3aefd4f0a8374c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——分项竞技大会。\n机伶金花出战的项目是，草地1600m。而在那里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd04456c91b40889a1c2da99702cbcabfe16d7d2572d9805dafd32a13ce26ff2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:840643b667658b7db7a35a6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛事粉丝A",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5cdc1e5b000c5819290f2772da1a236dc917ec9eef22492b0bc257af9f5aee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e40ebb59260ed9406d3c41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来了来了，杏目！\n在今年出道的赛马娘之中，她可是出类拔萃的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b081ce614b2b7e7319dc7d1b8d5235989b6f84ba3f6cde46df3cdbc7392fb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
