    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c668863b71bec99cb37bbf6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔——！　但是，还能追回来的！\n胜负要在进入直线之后才见分晓！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a42450238a7e95ef4bcb3d767e528c14d1100c938a75052e7109ff48c07e692",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e3c753523a5a7933f547c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果能保持这样下去的话，机伶金花也是有机会获胜的。\n然而，在最终直线——",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a188b38516b1e6be067e1510fb9a3cc954aa23ae1bdc76b56a6b2deaa4286e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18808c8ff9d1193e88da74cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
