      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花仿佛被这股气势压倒般退缩了。\n像往常一样，痛苦地扭曲了脸庞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f6891698b349a3aad30e62ad19f88c82f1422a69ef91c4c5f120c8ef77bda8",
