    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c014518d02e4d9f408c1cbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她，也就是机伶金花，总是会给训练员休息室\n带来鲜花装饰。是个性格温柔恬静的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "329f7b7b1acfe3b895cc9a2581acb47120916ede85173e15c3d820e6be24116e",
